        <item>The key to success is to focus on goals, not obstacles.</item>
        <item>Dream it. Believe it. Build it.</item>
        <item>Great things never come from comfort zones.</item>
        <item>Success doesn\'t just find you. You have to go out and get it.</item>
        <item>The way to get started is to quit talking and begin doing.</item>
