    <!-- Privacy Policy -->
    <string name="privacy_policy_content">Your privacy is important to us. ZenFlow collects and stores your habit and mood data locally on your device using SharedPreferences. We do not transmit your personal data to any external servers.\n\nData collected includes:\n• Habit names and completion status\n• Mood entries and notes\n• User profile information\n\nYou can delete your data at any time by clearing the app data from your device settings.</string>

